---
import SubpageLayout from "../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro";
---

<SubpageLayout
  title="作品 — bionickernel.com"
  description="用 versor-java 计算并导出为 SVG 的几何代数作品：P3 motor 与 E3 rotor field。"
  canonical="https://bionickernel.com/works/"
  active="works"
  eyebrow="Works · Geometric Algebra"
  heading="作品"
  lede="两幅由 versor-java 计算、Java 导出为 SVG 的几何代数习作。线条不是描出来的：每个顶点、每根向量都来自一次真实的多向量运算。"
  ogTitle="几何代数作品 | bionickernel.com"
  ogDescription="P3 motor 与 E3 rotor field：用 versor-java 计算并导出的两幅 SVG 作品。"
>
<style is:global>
  .works {
    margin-top: 1.9rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.6rem;
  }

  .work {
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--bg-elev);
  }

  .work-media {
    display: block;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #161925;
  }

  .work-media img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .work-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(15rem, 0.42fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem 1.3rem;
  }

  .work-copy h2 {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-transform: none;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .work-copy p {
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
    max-width: 40rem;
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .work-facts {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .work-facts div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 5.2rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.7rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.42rem;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line);
  }

  .work-facts div:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .work-facts dt {
    color: var(--faint);
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .work-facts dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .work-facts a {
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }

  .method {
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 1.3rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr);
    gap: 1.6rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .method h2 {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-transform: none;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .method p {
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
    max-width: 38rem;
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .method pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--bg);
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--dim);
  }

  .method code {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .method .kw {
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }

  .method .cm {
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .works-foot {
    margin-top: 1.3rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .work-body,
    .method {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="works">
  <article class="work">
    <a class="work-media" href="/assets/works/motor-cube.svg" aria-label="查看 Motor Cube 原图">
      <img
        src="/assets/works/motor-cube.svg"
        width="1000"
        height="640"
        alt="P3 motor 插值：一个立方体从起始位姿运动到终点位姿，九帧线框叠加。"
      />
    </a>
    <div class="work-body">
      <div class="work-copy">
        <p class="mono">01 · P3 / PGA3</p>
        <h2>Motor Cube</h2>
        <p>
          用 P3 motor 插值搬动一个立方体。起始位置用青色虚线标出，终点用橙色实线标出，中间九帧保留为轨迹；
          每个顶点的位置都经过 <code>M p ~M</code> 计算，再做透视投影。
        </p>
      </div>
      <dl class="work-facts">
        <div><dt>运算</dt><dd>P3.motor · P3.slerp · P3.apply</dd></div>
        <div><dt>采样</dt><dd>9 状态 · 12 边 · 8 顶点</dd></div>
        <div><dt>输出</dt><dd>SVG 1000×640</dd></div>
        <div><dt>源码</dt><dd>scripts/works/GenWorks.java</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="work">
    <a class="work-media" href="/assets/works/rotor-field.svg" aria-label="查看 Rotor Field 原图">
      <img
        src="/assets/works/rotor-field.svg"
        width="1000"
        height="640"
        alt="E3 rotor field：圆盘上 437 根向量，按半径与极角旋转，颜色随角度变化。"
      />
    </a>
    <div class="work-body">
      <div class="work-copy">
        <p class="mono">02 · E3</p>
        <h2>Rotor Field</h2>
        <p>
          在圆盘上取规则网格，每一点的向量由转子 <code>R = cos(θ/2) − sin(θ/2)e12</code> 旋转，
          角度随半径与极角变化。颜色表示旋转角，长度随半径衰减，整幅图是 437 次
          <code>R v ~R</code> 的结果。
        </p>
      </div>
      <dl class="work-facts">
        <div><dt>运算</dt><dd>E3.rotor · E3.rotate</dd></div>
        <div><dt>采样</dt><dd>437 vectors</dd></div>
        <div><dt>输出</dt><dd>SVG 1000×640</dd></div>
        <div><dt>源码</dt><dd>scripts/works/GenWorks.java</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>

<section class="method">
  <div>
    <p class="mono">Generation</p>
    <h2>从多向量到一条线</h2>
    <p>
      Java 程序只做三件事：调用 versor-java 得到变换后的坐标，投影到画布，写成 SVG。
      没有绘图库、没有浏览器端 3D，也不需要运行时依赖。重新生成：
    </p>
    <div class="works-foot">
      <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/GBLMX/versor-java" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        versor-java
        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="btn" href="/assets/works/motor-cube.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">打开 SVG 原图 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <pre><code><span class="cm">// scripts/works/generate.sh</span>
Multivector m = P3.motor(
    P3.rotor(0, 0, 1, radians(155)),
    P3.translator(1.15, 0.35, 0.75));
double[] q = P3.pointCoords(
    P3.apply(m, P3.point(x, y, z)));

<span class="cm">// E3</span>
Multivector r = E3.rotor(0, 0, 1, theta);
double[] v = E3.coords(E3.rotate(E3.vec(1, 0, 0), r));</code></pre>
</section>
</SubpageLayout>
